license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/pavanamthomas/mlops-reproducible-serving-lab
url: https://github.com/pavanamthomas/mlops-reproducible-serving-lab
abstract: >
  A small laboratory for making a trained classifier reproducible, testable,
  versioned, locally serveable, monitorable, and safely replaceable. The
  flagship failure is training-serving skew: an API can return HTTP 200
  while the serving transform is not the fitted training Pipeline.
keywords:
  - mlops
  - reproducibility
  - model serving
  - training-serving skew
  - data drift
  - concept drift
  - model versioning
  - FastAPI
  - MLflow
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-20"
